        <h2>Payment Failed ⚠️</h2>

        <p>Hello {{name}},</p>

        <p>Unfortunately, your payment could <strong>not be processed</strong>. Here are the details:</p>

        <div class="info-box">
            <strong>Order #{{rentalNumber}}</strong>
        </div>

        <table>
            <tr>
                <th>Amount:</th>
                <td>₹{{amount}}</td>
            </tr>
            {{#if reason}}
            <tr>
                <th>Reason:</th>
                <td>{{reason}}</td>
            </tr>
            {{/if}}
        </table>

        <p>Don't worry — you can try again anytime. Please check your payment method details or use a different payment option to avoid any interruption in your rental.</p>

        <p>If you need help, our support team is always here for you.</p>

        <p>Best Regards,<br>The RentEase Team</p>
